   "Rest 20 minutes.",
   "Roll to 4mm. Cut into rounds or flower shapes.",
   "Place on lined baking sheet.",
   "Brush with honey-water glaze.",
   "Bake at 170°C 15—18 minutes.",
   "Cool completely."
