   "note": "KEN080 (Coconut Prawns) and KEN079 (Prawn Curry) are both Swahili coastal prawn dishes. Prawn curry uses a tomato-based sauce; coconut prawns replaces the tomato base with coconut milk for a creamier, sweeter, more fragrant result. Both are quick and luxurious — the coconut version is the more celebratory of the two."
