   {
    "q": "What is the difference between coconut water and coconut milk?",
    "a": "Coconut water is the liquid inside a young green coconut. Coconut milk is made by pressing the grated flesh of a mature brown coconut. They are completely different — coconut water is thin and watery; coconut milk is thick and fatty."
   }
