   "Adapted from Sophia Musoki, 'Classic Katogo: Irish Potatoes, Yams and Sweet Potatoes with Beans', A Kitchen In Uganda (2015), also printed in her free ebook 16 Ugandan Dishes to Make (p.14). The layering order, the method and the stated refusal to give measurements are all hers."
